<html>
  <body>
    <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
    <p>Hello <strong>{{user.name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>
      We received a request to reset your password. You can reset your password
      by clicking the link below. This link expires in a short time.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="{{resetLink}}">Reset your password</a>
    </p>

    <p>If the button above doesn't work, use this token:</p>
    <pre>{{token}}</pre>

    <p>If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email.</p>
  </body>
</html>
